  "deadline": null,
  "last_verified": "2026-10-19",
  "summary_es": "Tu código usa modelos, APIs o parámetros de IA que ya no responden, tienen fecha de retiro o el modelo nuevo rechaza.",
  "why_es": "Los proveedores de modelos retiran IDs de modelo y endpoints con algunas semanas o meses de aviso. Después de la fecha, las llamadas fallan. Parche no reemplaza el modelo automáticamente porque cambiar de modelo cambia el comportamiento: te avisa, te dice la fecha y el reemplazo que recomienda el proveedor. También avisa los parámetros que los modelos nuevos rechazan, como `temperature`, `top_p` y `top_k` en Claude 4.7 y posteriores.",
  "sources": [
    { "title": "Anthropic: Model deprecations", "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations" },
    { "title": "Anthropic: Model deprecations, API parameter deprecations (temperature, top_p y top_k en Claude 4.7 y posteriores)", "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations#api-parameter-deprecations" },
    { "title": "Anthropic: API reference, Messages (valores que se aceptan: temperature 1, top_p desde 0.99, top_k ninguno)", "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/messages/create" },
    { "title": "Anthropic: Claude Haiku 5.5 migration guide (top_p solo 0.99; temperature y top_p juntos dan 400)", "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/haiku-5-5/migration-guide#remove-sampling-parameters" },
    { "title": "Anthropic: Claude Opus 5.5 migration guide (Opus 4.7 y posteriores, Sonnet 5; SDK de Python 1.0 y TypeError)", "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/opus-5-5/migration-guide" },
    { "title": "Anthropic: Claude Sonnet 5.5 migration guide (Sonnet 4.6 y anteriores y Haiku 4.5 aceptan los tres)", "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/sonnet-5-5/migration-guide" },
    { "title": "Anthropic: Claude Fable 5.1 and Claude Mythos 5.1 migration guide (la restricción de muestreo se mantiene)", "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/fable-5-1/migration-guide" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: Deprecations", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: Supervised fine-tuning (formato de los IDs ft:)", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/supervised-fine-tuning" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: Models (snapshots de cada familia y de cada modelo base)", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: Migrate from prompt objects (prompts reutilizables, IDs pmpt_)", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/prompting/migrate-from-prompt-object" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: Moving from OpenAI Evals to Promptfoo", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/cookbook/examples/evaluation/moving-from-openai-evals-to-promptfoo" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: API reference, Evals (métodos del SDK de Node y de Python)", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/evals" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: Migrate from Agent Builder", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/agent-builder/migrate-from-agent-builder" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: ChatKit (workflow alojado en Agent Builder; sessions.create exige un workflow)", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/chatkit" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: API reference, Videos (métodos del SDK de Node y de Python; sin reemplazo uno a uno)", "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/videos" },
    { "title": "OpenAI: SDK de Python, recurso videos (create_and_poll y poll)", "url": "https://github.com/openai/openai-python/blob/main/src/openai/resources/videos.py" }
  ],
